		{"id":"a000000000000009","type":"text","text":"# 年間サイクル\n(2027年から適用)\n\n2アンカー: **4月健診** + **8月の海**","x":-150,"y":-205,"width":280,"height":165},
		{"id":"a000000000000008","type":"text","text":"## ↩️ 9月下旬〜\nバルク再開準備","x":-650,"y":-440,"width":280,"height":120,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a000000000000007","type":"text","text":"## 🍚 8月〜9月中旬\nリバースダイエット\n2週ごと +100-150kcal → 82kg","x":-650,"y":-180,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"6"},
		{"id":"a000000000000001","type":"text","text":"## 🏋️ 10月〜2月中旬\n**バルク** 83-84 → ~86 kg\n(年間唯一の増量ブロック)","x":-170,"y":-440,"width":300,"height":120,"color":"4"},
		{"id":"a000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## ✂️ 2月中旬〜3月末\n**ミニカット** 6週\n→ 84.5-85 kg / BF ~15%","x":300,"y":-420,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"a000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## 🏥 4月上旬\n**健康診断** (アンカー1)\n84-85kg・ウエスト≤90・内臓脂肪≤7","x":300,"y":-180,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"a000000000000005","type":"text","text":"## 🔥 GW明け〜7月末\n**本カット** 12-13週\n84.5 → 80-81 kg / BF 11-12%\n(6月中旬にブレイク1週)","x":-160,"y":40,"width":300,"height":100,"color":"5"},
		{"id":"a000000000000004","type":"text","text":"## 😌 4月〜GW\nメンテ (回復・維持)","x":300,"y":50,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"3"},
		{"id":"a000000000000006","type":"text","text":"## 🏖️ 8月上旬\n**海** (アンカー2)\n年間ピークの絞り (本人決定)","x":-650,"y":50,"width":280,"height":80,"color":"1"},
		{"id":"b000000000000002","type":"text","text":"## Phase 2: Volume Block (10月〜)\n筋肥大特化・アイソレーション導入\nBIG3 +30-50kg/半年","x":-180,"y":200,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"2"},
		{"id":"b000000000000003","type":"text","text":"## Phase 3: Block Periodization (2028〜)\nピーキング導入・1RM 実測開始\n上級 470kg は 2029 想定","x":480,"y":200,"width":340,"height":100,"color":"6"},
